#. …苗木、遅いぞ。
#. 予定時刻より１分遅れだ。
msgctxt "0001 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You're one minute late, Makoto. How do you explain\n"
"this?"
msgstr ""

#. ご、ごめん…ちょっと体調が悪くて…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "S-Sorry. I'm not feeling so great today."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そんな使い古された言い訳…
#. 遅刻の理由に…なると思ってんの…？
msgctxt "0003 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"You r-really think a tired excuse like that i-is gonna\n"
"work?"
msgstr ""

#. あれ？　喋っていいんか？
msgctxt "0004 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Huh? Are you allowed to talk again?"
msgstr ""

#. 許可した覚えはないな…
msgctxt "0005 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I don't recall giving you permission..."
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0006 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr "Hả...?"

#. あ、あの…１日経ったから…
#. リセットされたのかと……
msgctxt "0007 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I-I just thought... I mean, since a d-day had passed,\n"
"it had maybe r-reset..."
msgstr ""

#. ごごごごめんなさい…嫌わないでください…
#. どどどんな罰でも…あああ甘んじて受けます…！
msgctxt "0008 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"S-S-S-S-Sorry! Please don't hate me! Whatever my\n"
"p-punishment is, I'll accept it!"
msgstr ""

#. 『私は悪い子です』ってプラカードを首から提げて…
#. トイレ掃除という罰で…どうでしょう？
msgctxt "0009 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I'll hang a s-sign from my neck that says \"Bad Girl\"!\n"
"I'll clean your bathroom w-with my toothbrush...!"
msgstr ""

#. その手の気持ち悪い発言をやめれば、
#. 許してやる…
msgctxt "0010 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If you stop making disgusting comments like that,\n"
"*maybe* I can forgive you."
msgstr ""

#. あ、あ、ありがとうございます…！
#. き、気持ち悪い事は…もう言いません…！
msgctxt "0011 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Th-Thank you! I won't make any more d-disgusting\n"
"comments, I promise...!"
msgstr ""

#. も、もし、気持ち悪い事言ったら…
#. このお口に…ゴミを突っ込んで構いません…
msgctxt "0012 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "If I do, you can stuff m-my mouth full of trash..."
msgstr ""

#. 白夜様専用の…ゴミ箱として使っていただいて
#. か、構いません…！！
msgctxt "0013 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"As long as i-it's you and no one else, I d-don't\n"
"mind...!"
msgstr ""

#. 駄目だ。染み込んでるべ…
msgctxt "0014 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "It's no use. She's disgusting to the bone..."
msgstr ""

#. …そんな事より、霧切ちゃんは？
#. まだ来てないみたいだけど…
msgctxt "0015 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Anyway, where's Kyoko? I haven't seen her this\n"
"morning..."
msgstr ""

#. こりゃ重役出勤どころじゃねーべ。
#. 社長レベルもすっ飛ばして大統領レベルだって！
msgctxt "0016 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Not cool! This is worse than being late for lunch, for\n"
"a date, for your wedding, for anything!"
msgstr ""

#. 昨日の事もあるから…
#. 怒って来なくなっちゃったのかな…
msgctxt "0017 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Maybe she's mad about what happened yesterday, and\n"
"she's not gonna show up anymore..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんが来ない理由…
#. みんなに言うのはまずいんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't tell the others why Kyoko might not be here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今は…黙ってるしかないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The best thing to do right now is just keep quiet.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それにしても、あいつはどこで何をしているんだ？
#. 自分の部屋にも入れないというのに…
msgctxt "0021 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Whatever her reason, I'm curious to know what she *is*\n"
"doing. I know she's not in her room, so..."
msgstr ""

#. そうか…鍵を取ったままだったべ…
msgctxt "0022 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Oh yeah, you still have her key, right?"
msgstr ""

#. おや、霧切さんをお捜しかな！？
msgctxt "0023 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Ah, are you looking for Miss Kirigiri?"
msgstr ""

#. うぉッ！　今度はなんの用だ！？
msgctxt "0024 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Wgah! What do you want now!?"
msgstr ""

#. そうなんでしょ？　霧切さんを捜してるんでしょ？
msgctxt "0025 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I'm right, right? You're wondering where Miss Kirigiri\n"
"is, right?"
msgstr ""

#. お、お前は知ってるのかよ…？
#. 霧切さんの居場所…
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "D-Do you know where she is...?"
msgstr ""

#. えっと……
#. さぁ…どうかしらね…
msgctxt "0027 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Hmm... Well, it's hard to say..."
msgstr ""

#. …ん？　オメーも知らんのか！？
msgctxt "0028 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Huh? You don't know, either!?"
msgstr ""

#. 知らないからこそ、ここに顔を出したんだろう？
#. 俺達から何かを探る為に…
msgctxt "0029 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It's because he doesn't know. That's why he's here—to\n"
"try and prod us for information."
msgstr ""

#. ところで、好きなマンガを聞かれた時に、
#. マイナーマンガを答えるヤツってムカつくよね？
msgctxt "0030 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Hey, don'tcha hate it when you ask someone what their\n"
"favorite movie is, and they name some indie bullcrap?"
msgstr ""

#. ろ、露骨過ぎるわよ…話の変え方が…
msgctxt "0031 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I feel like I'm g-getting whiplash, the way he changes\n"
"s-subjects like that..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、間違いない…
#. モノクマは本当に気付いていないんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Thank goodness. It looks like Monokuma really didn't\n"
"notice...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>じゃあ、昨日の計画はうまくいったんだな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So I guess our plan went off just fine last night.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which could mean...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. もしかしたら、黒幕は私達の監視とモノクマの操作を
#. <CLT 3>同時に行えない<CLT>のかもしれない…
msgctxt "0035 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Maybe the mastermind can't monitor us and control\n"
"Monokuma <CLT 3>at the same time<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そういう事…なのか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Could she have been right about that?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. で、どうなの？　霧切さんを捜してるんでしょ？
#. 心当たりはあるの？
msgctxt "0037 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"So? Was I right? You're looking for Miss Kirigiri! Any\n"
"idea where she might have gone...?"
msgstr ""

#. …知らんな。
msgctxt "0038 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...We have no idea."
msgstr ""

#. 知ってても教えないし！
msgctxt "0039 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "And even if we did know, we wouldn't tell *you*!"
msgstr ""

#. 当然だべ！
msgctxt "0040 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "For serious!"
msgstr ""

#. ふーん…あっそ…
msgctxt "0041 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Hmm... I see..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、いいよ…
#. もういいよ……
msgctxt "0042 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Well, fine. Whatever!"
msgstr ""

#. もう、何もかもがどうでもいいんだ。
#. バイバイ！
msgctxt "0043 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I don't even care anymore! Sayonara, suckers!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…モノクマが去った後、
#. ボクらはすぐに顔を見合わせた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As soon as he was gone, we all glanced around at each\n"
"other.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、今のってどういう事？
#. モノクマも、霧切ちゃんの居場所を知らないって事？
msgctxt "0045 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"So...what was that just now? Does that mean Monokuma\n"
"doesn't know where she is, either?"
msgstr ""

#. どうやら…そのようだな…
msgctxt "0046 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "It would seem that way..."
msgstr ""

#. だとすると、
#. 霧切っちはどこに姿を消したってんだ？
msgctxt "0047 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Where the heck could she have gone...?"
msgstr ""

#. …みんなで捜した方がいいんじゃない？
msgctxt "0048 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Don't you think we should all go look for her?"
msgstr ""

#. どうやって捜すというんだ？
#. モノクマにも見つけられないんだぞ…
msgctxt "0049 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And how would you suggest we approach that task?\n"
"Even Monokuma can't seem to locate her..."
msgstr ""

#. つーか、なんでモノクマが見つけらんねーんだ？
msgctxt "0050 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Yeah...how can he not know where she is?"
msgstr ""

#. 謎だよね…
msgctxt "0051 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "So strange..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>きっと、霧切さんは、あの鍵を使って、
#. この学園の“どこか”に忍び込んだはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko must have used that key to sneak into some\n"
"unknown part of the school...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、それってどこだ？
#. モノクマにも気付かれない場所があるなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But somewhere even Monokuma wouldn't notice? Where\n"
"could it be...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いなくなった霧切さんについて話し合いながら、
#. 朝食を食べた後…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We spent the rest of breakfast talking about where\n"
"Kyoko could have gone.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクらは、それぞれの個室へと戻っていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Afterwards, we returned to our rooms.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
